        "detailed_description": "<h1>关于我们</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord: ysbxSfYaQs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our players’ QQ group chat: 1015801003</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher's Homepage: Click on the publisher “Eternal Dream” to visit our homepage. Follow us to get more updates on the game!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual point and click puzzle game centered around dress-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our female fashion designer, Min Ku, is unable to work now, so her loyal dog steps in to help her with her wardrobe. Join the doggie through eight levels and complete the client's missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might also be interested in:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Pretty outfits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Cute cartoon characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Eight dress-up levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-One linear ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-14 CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun! ૮ ・ﻌ・ა Woof!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446920/extras/6f11b9810800a752f2b8d578818aa5c4.avif?t=1789146344\" width=270 height=270 /></span></p>",
